{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16632","headline":"元日早朝行 · 鲍防","name":"元日早朝行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乾元发生春爲宗，盛德在木斗建东。\n东方岁星大明宫，南山喜气摇晴空。\n望云五等舞万玉，献寿一声出千峰。\n文昌随彩礼乐正，太平下直旌旗红。\n师旷应律调黄锺，王良运策调时龙。\n玄冥无事归朔土，青帝放身入朱宫。\n九韶九变五声里，四方四友一身中。\n天何言哉乐无穷，广成彭祖爲三公。\n野臣潜随击壤老，日下鼓腹歌可封。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍防","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16632.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16632","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}